"""callrec: record every call on your Mac (your mic + everything the Mac plays) and
transcribe it locally. Hebrew uses the ivrit.ai model, English uses Whisper large-v3-turbo.

Usage:
  callrec                      auto mode: waits for a meeting, records it, transcribes it
  callrec NAME                 record now (stops on Enter or when the meeting ends)
  callrec list                 what you recorded
  callrec transcribe FILE...   transcribe any audio file (transcript next to it)
  callrec import FILE...       add an audio/video file to your recordings and transcribe it
  callrec recover [FOLDER...]  finish recordings that were cut off
  callrec selftest             record 5 seconds and check both sides come through
  callrec doctor               check setup
"""
